%% HAND-AUTHORED — sys-05 §14 request lifecycle (7 phases, no sequenceDiagram in spec).
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Orchestrator
    participant SafetyService
    participant ContentService
    participant GoogleLiveFlash
    participant Redis
    participant PostgreSQL

    Orchestrator->>SafetyService: POST /internal/v1/conversation/generate {sessionId, turnId, transcript, ageBand, recentTurns}
    SafetyService->>PostgreSQL: INSERT conversation_requests intake row
    SafetyService->>SafetyService: classify intent + input safety filter
    SafetyService->>Redis: GET household:{hh}:budget_counters
    alt budget_exceeded
        Redis-->>SafetyService: tokens >= 50000/hr OR cost >= $0.50/day
        SafetyService-->>Orchestrator: block_with_fallback budget_exceeded
    else circuit_open
        SafetyService->>ContentService: POST /internal/v1/personalization/retrieve
        ContentService-->>SafetyService: {traits, prefs, memories, templates}
        Note over SafetyService: primary circuit open — skip primary
        SafetyService-->>Orchestrator: block_with_fallback model_timeout
    else model_timeout_secondary
        SafetyService->>ContentService: POST /internal/v1/personalization/retrieve
        ContentService-->>SafetyService: {traits, prefs, memories, templates}
        SafetyService->>GoogleLiveFlash: primary generate
        GoogleLiveFlash--xSafetyService: 2000ms first-token timeout
        SafetyService->>GoogleLiveFlash: secondary attempt
        GoogleLiveFlash--xSafetyService: timeout
        SafetyService-->>Orchestrator: block_with_fallback model_timeout
    else model_malformed_secondary
        SafetyService->>GoogleLiveFlash: primary generate
        GoogleLiveFlash-->>SafetyService: response did not parse
        SafetyService->>GoogleLiveFlash: secondary attempt
        GoogleLiveFlash-->>SafetyService: still unparseable
        SafetyService-->>Orchestrator: block_with_fallback model_malformed_output
    else allow
        SafetyService->>ContentService: POST /internal/v1/personalization/retrieve
        ContentService-->>SafetyService: {traits, prefs, memories, templates}
        SafetyService->>GoogleLiveFlash: primary generate
        GoogleLiveFlash-->>SafetyService: {textSegments, renderPlan, motionPlan}
        SafetyService->>SafetyService: parse + normalize + output safety filter + final gate
        SafetyService->>Redis: INCR household:{hh}:budget_counters
        SafetyService->>PostgreSQL: INSERT generation_attempts + safety_decisions
        SafetyService-)SafetyService: emit conv-analytics + 1% conv-model-eval-sample
        SafetyService-->>Orchestrator: allow {intent, textSegments, renderPlan, motionPlan, safetySummary}
    end
    Note over Orchestrator,PostgreSQL: secondary attempt forbidden when blocked by safety or budget exhausted
